{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00337",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 5.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.96,
      "end_seconds": 10.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.09,
      "end_seconds": 21.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. It's pain in my right ear, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.92,
      "end_seconds": 23.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.58,
      "end_seconds": 34.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Ever since... since Friday, really. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.66,
      "end_seconds": 41.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Alright, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.93,
      "end_seconds": 66.34,
      "duration_seconds": 22.41,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week. Moderate, I'd say. I did try to ignore it for a while. And, And there's a runny nose before it started as well, two days now. And a fever, too. I've, I've had a blocked feeling in the ear too, for ten days. About blocked feeling in the ear, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.83,
      "end_seconds": 67.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "What about dizziness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.15,
      "end_seconds": 69.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "No. No dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 70.56,
      "end_seconds": 75.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Um, actually, doctor, I did notice dizziness. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.4,
      "end_seconds": 82.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Um, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any ringing, recent swim or swelling behind the ear at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.54,
      "end_seconds": 95.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Okay, so no, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.55,
      "end_seconds": 97.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.8,
      "end_seconds": 100.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.03,
      "end_seconds": 112.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.59,
      "end_seconds": 115.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.83,
      "end_seconds": 116.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.66,
      "end_seconds": 121.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.48,
      "end_seconds": 127.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.08,
      "end_seconds": 131.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 132.58,
      "end_seconds": 142.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Well, um, doctor, I think the last prescription for the telmisartan was 80 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.18,
      "end_seconds": 147.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Alright, I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.62,
      "end_seconds": 156.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.51,
      "end_seconds": 161.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.68,
      "end_seconds": 169.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for five years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.71,
      "end_seconds": 171.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.63,
      "end_seconds": 177.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "COPD, for five years. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.95,
      "end_seconds": 179.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.75,
      "end_seconds": 187.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.77,
      "end_seconds": 192.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Yeah, my mother has migraines. Um, my mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.38,
      "end_seconds": 195.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.72,
      "end_seconds": 199.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.96,
      "end_seconds": 204.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.21,
      "end_seconds": 207.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.58,
      "end_seconds": 209.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.76,
      "end_seconds": 212.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 216.21,
      "end_seconds": 223.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature is 38.0 degrees, saturation 97 percent, BP is 116 over 78, pulse 104."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.29,
      "end_seconds": 225.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.84,
      "end_seconds": 230.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.84,
      "end_seconds": 232.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.68,
      "end_seconds": 236.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.0,
      "end_seconds": 247.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "The right eardrum looks red and bulging."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.29,
      "end_seconds": 250.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.75,
      "end_seconds": 268.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "The left ear looks normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.77,
      "end_seconds": 270.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.55,
      "end_seconds": 298.21,
      "duration_seconds": 22.66,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.4,
      "end_seconds": 301.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.74,
      "end_seconds": 312.19,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is a middle ear infection. I'd also keep a wax blockage in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.97,
      "end_seconds": 320.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, uh, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.14,
      "end_seconds": 336.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.61,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a middle ear infection. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your right ear, since Friday, moderate, and no swelling behind the ear or recent swim."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.2,
      "end_seconds": 340.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.85,
      "end_seconds": 362.65,
      "duration_seconds": 21.8,
      "text": "Let's use azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day, for three days. That should help with ear infection. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Keep the ear dry for now and don't put anything in it, including cotton buds. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.05,
      "end_seconds": 370.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.11,
      "end_seconds": 375.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.86,
      "end_seconds": 388.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.72,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you get discharge, swelling behind the ear or the pain gets much worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Come back in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.7,
      "end_seconds": 390.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.0,
      "end_seconds": 396.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.14,
      "end_seconds": 405.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "So, I take the azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day and come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.4,
      "end_seconds": 409.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.9,
      "end_seconds": 418.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}